//! Icons — Phosphor, regular weight, colour inherited from the text.
//!
//! Only the icons the interface uses are vendored, as path data, so no icon
//! font and no CDN is loaded at runtime. Adding one means copying its path
//! from `assets/regular/<name>.svg` of the package.
